Subject: [PATCH 0816/3799] soh: rename func_80078E84 ->
 HealthMeter_DrainDisplayedAndKill

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the counterpart drain: ticks a 0x140 delay, then lowers the animated health by 0x10, and on reaching zero deals damage exceeding current health -- i.e. kills the player. Unused, but the arithmetic is unambiguous.
Defined in soh/src/code/z_lifemeter.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
